# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Altium Designer - Git Ignore Rules
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Auto-generated project structure / variants (can be regenerated)
*.PrjPcbStructure
*.PrjPcbVariants

# Backup / temporary files created by Altium (e.g. *.~(1).PcbDoc.Zip)
*.~*
*.*~
~$*

# Auto-save / recovery files
*.RawSchBin
*.RawPcbBin
*.SchDocPreview
*.PcbDocPreview

# History snapshots created by Altium's built-in version history
History/
**/History/

# Project logs (DRC, ECO, compilation, etc.)
Project Logs*/
**/Project Logs*/
* ECO *.LOG
* DRC *.LOG
*.LOG

# Thumbnail / preview cache
__Previews/
**/__Previews/

# Generated manufacturing / documentation outputs
Project Outputs for */
**/Project Outputs for */
Fabrication Outputs/
**/Fabrication Outputs/
Assembly Outputs/
**/Assembly Outputs/
Documentation Outputs/
**/Documentation Outputs/

# CAM / manufacturing files (Gerber, NC drill, ODB++, pick & place, BOM, etc.)
*.Cam
*.GBL
*.GBO
*.GBP
*.GBS
*.GKO
*.GML
*.GP1
*.GP2
*.GTL
*.GTO
*.GTP
*.GTS
*.P01
*.DRL
*.TXT
*.APR
*.APR_LIB
*.EXTREP
*.REP
*.RUL
*.DFR
*.ODB
*.tgz
*.tar.gz

# Reports / exports that are regenerated
*.html
*.htm
*.csv
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.pdf
*.bmp
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg

# Local IDE / OS metadata
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp
*.temp
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep source design files tracked:
# *.PrjPcb, *.SchDoc, *.PcbDoc, *.SchLib, *.PcbLib, *.OutJob
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
